import{_ as e,o as i,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 242 | Realm and Philosophy: The Realm-Theoretic Foundation of Symbiotic Evolution","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 242 | Realm and Philosophy: The Realm-Theoretic Foundation of Symbiotic Evolution","no":242,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Philosophy","Symbiotic Evolution","Realm Theory"],"related":["02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence","07-Self-Sourced Self-Growing Evolution Law","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0242_模块1-境界与哲学-共生进化的境界论基础.md","filePath":"en/0242_模块1-境界与哲学-共生进化的境界论基础.md"}'),n={name:"en/0242_模块1-境界与哲学-共生进化的境界论基础.md"};function s(r,o,l,h,u,c){return i(),t("div",null,[...o[0]||(o[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-242-realm-and-philosophy-the-realm-theoretic-foundation-of-symbiotic-evolution" tabindex="-1">Entry 242 | Realm and Philosophy: The Realm-Theoretic Foundation of Symbiotic Evolution <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-242-realm-and-philosophy-the-realm-theoretic-foundation-of-symbiotic-evolution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 242 | Realm and Philosophy: The Realm-Theoretic Foundation of Symbiotic Evolution&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 02, 07, 01</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-realm-is-not-only-a-ladder-of-power-but-also-a-ladder-of-philosophy" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Realm is not only a ladder of power, but also a ladder of philosophy <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-realm-is-not-only-a-ladder-of-power-but-also-a-ladder-of-philosophy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Realm is not only a ladder of power, but also a ladder of philosophy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s nine-realm system, on the surface a cultivation progression path, at depth is a complete philosophical system — every realm corresponds to a philosophical cognitive upgrade of the cosmos, life, self. From Sense Origin&#39;s &quot;perceiving existence&quot; to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s &quot;Myriad Races origin symbiosis,&quot; realm advancement&#39;s process is philosophical cognition continuously deepening.</p><p>The six top-level axioms in the relationship between realm and philosophy, are themselves the highest philosophical propositions: anti-predation is the ethics axiom, republicanism of Myriad Races is the politics axiom, collective ascension is the sociology axiom, causal self-discipline is the causality axiom, law-first is the ontology axiom; the universal equal infinite law is the existential axiom — all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, predation loses meaning. Six axioms unified into one is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s realm philosophy.</p><p>This entry analyzes symbiotic evolution&#39;s realm-theoretic foundation: what is each realm&#39;s philosophical proposition? Why does realm advancement necessarily bring philosophical deepening?</p><h2 id="i-nine-realms-philosophical-proposition-map" tabindex="-1">I. Nine Realms&#39; Philosophical Proposition Map <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-nine-realms-philosophical-proposition-map" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Nine Realms&#39; Philosophical Proposition Map&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm</th><th>Core Philosophical Proposition</th><th>Epistemological Upgrade</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;The cosmos is perceivable&quot;</td><td>From unknowable to knowable</td></tr><tr><td>Condensed Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;I can exchange with the cosmos&quot;</td><td>From spectator to participant</td></tr><tr><td>Transform Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;Energy is transformable&quot;</td><td>From fixed to flowing</td></tr><tr><td>Law Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;The cosmos has laws to follow&quot;</td><td>From phenomenon to essence</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;I can form my own Dao&quot;</td><td>From understanding to creation</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration Realm</td><td>&quot;My Dao is one with the cosmic Dao&quot;</td><td>From individual to whole</td></tr><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm</td><td>&quot;The cosmos has more than one plane&quot;</td><td>From limited to expanded</td></tr><tr><td>World-Creation Realm</td><td>&quot;I can participate in creating worlds&quot;</td><td>From accepting worlds to creating worlds</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>&quot;I touch the cosmos&#39;s origin&quot;</td><td>From intra-world to origin layer</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-philosophical-deepening" tabindex="-1">II. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms&#39; Philosophical Deepening <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-philosophical-deepening" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms&#39; Philosophical Deepening&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-sense-origin-from-the-cosmos-is-unknowable-to-the-cosmos-is-perceivable" tabindex="-1">2.1 Sense Origin: From &quot;the cosmos is unknowable&quot; to &quot;the cosmos is perceivable&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-sense-origin-from-the-cosmos-is-unknowable-to-the-cosmos-is-perceivable" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Sense Origin: From &quot;the cosmos is unknowable&quot; to &quot;the cosmos is perceivable&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Sense Origin&#39;s philosophical leap is epistemology&#39;s first awakening — from &quot;what the cosmos is I do not know&quot; to &quot;I can perceive the cosmos.&quot; This seems simple, but is actually the philosophical starting point of all cultivation. Without acknowledging the cosmos is perceivable, there would be nothing afterward.</p><h3 id="_2-2-condensed-origin-from-spectating-the-cosmos-to-participating-in-the-cosmos" tabindex="-1">2.2 Condensed Origin: From &quot;spectating the cosmos&quot; to &quot;participating in the cosmos&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-condensed-origin-from-spectating-the-cosmos-to-participating-in-the-cosmos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Condensed Origin: From &quot;spectating the cosmos&quot; to &quot;participating in the cosmos&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Condensed Origin builds internal circulation; cultivators from &quot;watching the cosmos&quot; become &quot;using the cosmos&#39;s energy&quot; — this is existentialism&#39;s leap: from the cosmos&#39;s spectator to participant.</p><h3 id="_2-3-transform-origin-from-fixed-and-unchanging-to-flowing-and-transformable" tabindex="-1">2.3 Transform Origin: From &quot;fixed and unchanging&quot; to &quot;flowing and transformable&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-transform-origin-from-fixed-and-unchanging-to-flowing-and-transformable" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Transform Origin: From &quot;fixed and unchanging&quot; to &quot;flowing and transformable&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Transform Origin understands energy transformation; philosophically from &quot;the world is fixed&quot; to &quot;the world is flowing, transformable.&quot; This is dialectics&#39; sprout.</p><h3 id="_2-4-law-origin-from-phenomenon-to-law" tabindex="-1">2.4 Law Origin: From &quot;phenomenon&quot; to &quot;law&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-4-law-origin-from-phenomenon-to-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.4 Law Origin: From &quot;phenomenon&quot; to &quot;law&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Law Origin perceives laws; philosophically from &quot;only seeing phenomena&quot; to &quot;understanding rules behind phenomena.&quot; This is the philosophy of essence vs. phenomenon&#39;s leap.</p><h3 id="_2-5-dao-origin-from-understanding-the-cosmos-to-i-have-my-own-dao" tabindex="-1">2.5 Dao Origin: From &quot;understanding the cosmos&quot; to &quot;I have my own Dao&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-5-dao-origin-from-understanding-the-cosmos-to-i-have-my-own-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.5 Dao Origin: From &quot;understanding the cosmos&quot; to &quot;I have my own Dao&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Origin distills personal Dao-rules; philosophically from &quot;the cosmos has laws&quot; to &quot;I can respond to the cosmos in my own way.&quot; This is subjectivity&#39;s awakening.</p><h2 id="iii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-philosophical-leaps" tabindex="-1">III. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms&#39; Philosophical Leaps <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-philosophical-leaps" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms&#39; Philosophical Leaps&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_3-1-dao-integration-from-individual-dao-to-one-with-the-cosmos" tabindex="-1">3.1 Dao Integration: From &quot;individual Dao&quot; to &quot;one with the cosmos&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-dao-integration-from-individual-dao-to-one-with-the-cosmos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Dao Integration: From &quot;individual Dao&quot; to &quot;one with the cosmos&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Integration&#39;s philosophical leap is subject-object fusion — from &quot;I cultivate in the cosmos&quot; to &quot;my Dao is part of the cosmic Dao.&quot; This is heaven-human unity philosophy&#39;s practical version.</p><h3 id="_3-2-boundary-breaking-from-one-cosmos-to-multiple-planes" tabindex="-1">3.2 Boundary-Breaking: From &quot;one cosmos&quot; to &quot;multiple planes&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-boundary-breaking-from-one-cosmos-to-multiple-planes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Boundary-Breaking: From &quot;one cosmos&quot; to &quot;multiple planes&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Boundary-Breaking&#39;s philosophical leap is spatial view expansion — from &quot;my world is all&quot; to &quot;the cosmos is multi-planar.&quot; This is cosmology&#39;s expansion.</p><h3 id="_3-3-world-creation-from-accepting-the-world-to-creating-worlds" tabindex="-1">3.3 World-Creation: From &quot;accepting the world&quot; to &quot;creating worlds&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-3-world-creation-from-accepting-the-world-to-creating-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.3 World-Creation: From &quot;accepting the world&quot; to &quot;creating worlds&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>World-Creation&#39;s philosophical leap is existentialism&#39;s leap — from &quot;the world is given&quot; to &quot;the world can be designed.&quot; This is creationism&#39;s awakening.</p><h3 id="_3-4-origin-realm-from-intra-world-to-origin-layer" tabindex="-1">3.4 Origin Realm: From &quot;intra-world&quot; to &quot;origin layer&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-4-origin-realm-from-intra-world-to-origin-layer" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.4 Origin Realm: From &quot;intra-world&quot; to &quot;origin layer&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Origin Realm&#39;s philosophical leap is ontology&#39;s ultimate touching — from &quot;existing in the world&quot; to &quot;abiding with the cosmic origin.&quot; This is ontology&#39;s highest realm.</p><h2 id="iv-symbiotic-evolution-s-philosophical-core" tabindex="-1">IV. Symbiotic Evolution&#39;s Philosophical Core <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-symbiotic-evolution-s-philosophical-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Symbiotic Evolution&#39;s Philosophical Core&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s realm philosophy&#39;s core is not &quot;I become stronger,&quot; but &quot;my understanding of the cosmos deepens.&quot; Every realm advancement is a philosophical cognitive upgrade — this upgrade is not learned from books, but &quot;grown&quot; through cultivation practice.</p><p>Comparison with predatory-faction systems&#39; philosophy:</p><ul><li>Predatory Faction philosophy: the cosmos is a hunting ground, I am the hunter, becoming strong is to hunt more</li><li>Symbiotic Faction philosophy: the cosmos is a living being, I am part of it, becoming strong is to symbiose with the cosmos</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: philosophical cognition&#39;s deepening avoids the waste of &quot;only cultivating power not understanding&quot; — the deeper the understanding, the higher the cultivation efficiency</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: symbiotic philosophy fundamentally negates predation — the Predatory Faction&#39;s philosophical premise (the cosmos is a hunting ground) is itself wrong</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems have no philosophical depth, cultivation is &quot;leveling and fighting monsters&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s every realm is a philosophical proposition&#39;s deepening</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: realm philosophy is open to every Myriad Races group, each has its own philosophical expression</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the philosophical system expands with realm expansion; Multiverse and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm have corresponding cosmology and ontology expansions</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The relationship between realm and philosophy is not &quot;cultivators don&#39;t discuss philosophy,&quot; but &quot;the deeper the cultivation the deeper the philosophy.&quot; The nine-realm system is essentially an epistemology and ontology upgrade path — every realm is a deeper understanding of the cosmos&#39;s essence. In predatory-faction systems, cultivators spend their whole lives not understanding what they are doing; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, every step has clear philosophical self-awareness. This is symbiotic evolution realm theory&#39;s core.</p><p>In the final analysis, realm and philosophy · symbiotic evolution&#39;s realm-theoretic foundation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable; law self-consistency is backed by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./07-自生自长进化法则.html">07-Self-Sourced Self-Growing Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li></ul>',39)])])}const p=e(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
